WEBVTT

00:00:10.686 --> 00:00:11.687
Hey!

00:00:12.062 --> 00:00:13.146
Posters up!

00:00:13.355 --> 00:00:15.649
-You...
-Now, run away!

00:00:15.732 --> 00:00:17.651
Come back here, you vandals!

00:00:33.792 --> 00:00:35.168
(PIGLETS CHATTERING)

00:00:35.252 --> 00:00:37.170
Rosita, have you seen my car... Whoa!

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:43.802
Rosita? What the...

00:00:43.885 --> 00:00:45.053
What's going on?

00:00:46.096 --> 00:00:47.347
Rosita! (GASPS)

00:00:51.435 --> 00:00:52.477
(PIGLETS LAUGHING)

00:00:52.602 --> 00:00:53.687
Kids, where's Mommy?

00:00:55.439 --> 00:00:56.565
(PLAYING JAZZ MUSIC)

00:01:00.402 --> 00:01:01.403
Phew!

00:01:02.028 --> 00:01:03.363
How's that, Miss Crawly?

00:01:03.947 --> 00:01:05.282
(SNORING)

00:01:05.407 --> 00:01:06.408
-Hey!
-(SHRIEKS) Oh!

00:01:07.325 --> 00:01:08.285
Sorry!

00:01:08.368 --> 00:01:11.204
Mr. Moon would like everyone to meet
backstage before she arrives.

00:01:12.330 --> 00:01:14.249
(SINGING BALLAD)

00:01:20.589 --> 00:01:21.590
BUSTER: Wow.

00:01:22.007 --> 00:01:23.049
You wrote that?

00:01:23.425 --> 00:01:26.011
Uh, yeah. Do you like it?

00:01:26.094 --> 00:01:28.847
Are you kidding? It's fantastic!

00:01:28.972 --> 00:01:30.640
You've got to sing that today!

00:01:32.392 --> 00:01:33.602
Mike, you're on first.

00:01:33.685 --> 00:01:35.604
-(CELL PHONE RINGING)
-Sure. Just a second here.

00:01:35.687 --> 00:01:36.688
Honey, I'm busy.

00:01:36.772 --> 00:01:37.939
What? I can't hear you.

00:01:38.106 --> 00:01:41.151
Rosita and Gunter, you're on after Mike.

00:01:41.234 --> 00:01:43.153
-You got it, boss.
-Rosita!

00:01:43.236 --> 00:01:46.406
(CHUCKLES) Super cool!
You've, like, totally come back!

00:01:46.490 --> 00:01:48.408
Okay, Johnny, you follow them.

00:01:48.492 --> 00:01:51.453
What? Oh, yeah. I'm ready. Yeah, yeah.

00:01:51.536 --> 00:01:52.496
Ash, you're...

00:01:52.579 --> 00:01:53.830
After Johnny. I got it.

00:01:53.914 --> 00:01:55.457
And Meena. Last chance, kid.

00:01:55.582 --> 00:01:57.667
You wanna join these guys out there today?

00:01:57.834 --> 00:02:00.754
I would... I just get so scared.

00:02:00.879 --> 00:02:01.922
Sure, you do.

00:02:02.005 --> 00:02:04.216
(STAMMERS) But you know
how to get over that, right?

00:02:04.299 --> 00:02:05.675
Uh, no.

00:02:05.967 --> 00:02:07.969
You just start singing! (CHUCKLES)

00:02:08.053 --> 00:02:09.554
Do what you love, then you'll be great,

00:02:09.679 --> 00:02:10.722
'cause you won't be afraid anymore,

00:02:10.806 --> 00:02:12.140
because you'll actually be doing it.

00:02:12.224 --> 00:02:13.308
Right?

00:02:13.391 --> 00:02:14.893
Uh...

00:02:14.976 --> 00:02:17.354
Look, do you love to sing?

00:02:17.437 --> 00:02:19.022
I mean, do you really love it?

00:02:19.564 --> 00:02:20.649
Of course I do.

00:02:20.732 --> 00:02:22.192
Then you face this head on, Meena.

00:02:22.943 --> 00:02:23.902
Look, it's like my dad always said,

00:02:23.985 --> 00:02:26.905
"Don't let fear stop you
from doing the thing you love."

00:02:27.781 --> 00:02:29.825
Uh... (CHUCKLES) Okay, I'll do it.

00:02:29.908 --> 00:02:31.576
-Great!
-Mr. Moon!

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:33.203
She's here!

00:02:47.676 --> 00:02:48.677
Nana!

00:02:49.845 --> 00:02:52.430
Oh! Do not even think of embracing me.

00:02:52.514 --> 00:02:55.559
You got it. Eddie,
please show your nana to the royal box.

00:02:55.642 --> 00:02:58.979
Oh, for heaven sakes!
I'm perfectly capable of walking.

00:03:00.021 --> 00:03:01.857
-You nervous?
-Are you kidding?

00:03:01.940 --> 00:03:04.401
(NERVOUS CHUCKLE) I'm absolutely terrified.

00:03:09.614 --> 00:03:10.615
(TIRES SCREECH)

00:03:11.116 --> 00:03:14.244
Boss, that's his car, isn't it? Right there!

00:03:15.871 --> 00:03:16.997
Pull over.

00:03:21.877 --> 00:03:25.505
Lapsang souchong, courtesy of Mr. Moon...

00:03:25.589 --> 00:03:26.840
(SNEEZES)

00:03:26.923 --> 00:03:29.134
-Oh...
-Wonderful.

00:03:29.217 --> 00:03:30.343
(BELL RINGING)

00:03:32.804 --> 00:03:34.639
(STAMMERS) Honey,
the show is starting, all right?

00:03:34.723 --> 00:03:36.641
I can't talk now. I gotta go.

00:03:36.725 --> 00:03:37.767
Of course I love you.

00:03:37.851 --> 00:03:39.644
You think I'd buy you
diamond earrings if I didn't...

00:03:40.103 --> 00:03:41.104
(SHRIEKS)

00:03:41.229 --> 00:03:42.230
Where is my money?

00:03:42.647 --> 00:03:43.648
Okay, okay, listen, listen.

00:03:43.732 --> 00:03:47.110
I just, maybe, kind of, spent it all.

00:03:47.527 --> 00:03:48.528
You know?

00:03:49.029 --> 00:03:50.989
(SHRIEKS) No, no,
please, please, wait! I'll give you the money!

00:03:51.072 --> 00:03:53.074
I'll get you $100,000!

00:03:54.284 --> 00:03:57.245
(LAUGHS) Where are you going
to get that kind of money?

00:03:57.329 --> 00:03:58.371
Moon! Okay?

00:03:59.247 --> 00:04:00.290
Moon's got my money.

00:04:01.917 --> 00:04:03.960
Who is this "Moon"?

00:04:05.921 --> 00:04:07.047
(SIGHS)

00:04:07.422 --> 00:04:12.427
All creatures great and small,
welcome to the Moon Theater!

00:04:13.470 --> 00:04:16.139
I am your host, Buster Moon, and...

00:04:16.431 --> 00:04:17.724
Whoa!

00:04:20.185 --> 00:04:22.646
Okay. Behold!

00:04:22.729 --> 00:04:27.400
The very first stage
lit entirely by squid power!

00:04:28.109 --> 00:04:29.736
-(MUSIC PLAYING)
-(AUDIENCE GASPING)

00:04:31.905 --> 00:04:32.906
(APPLAUSE)

00:04:34.407 --> 00:04:35.492
(CHEERING)

00:04:35.617 --> 00:04:36.618
Yeah!

00:04:37.118 --> 00:04:39.746
Beautiful work, guys.
Now, just follow me on the beat.

00:04:42.290 --> 00:04:45.251
And as you can see,
this is no ordinary theater.

00:04:45.335 --> 00:04:48.672
This is a palace of wonder and magic.

00:04:49.172 --> 00:04:50.173
(LAUGHS)

00:04:50.256 --> 00:04:52.217
He's done it! He's really done it, Nana!

00:04:52.968 --> 00:04:54.886
Oh! Goodness!

00:04:54.970 --> 00:04:57.389
Now, welcome our first contestant.

00:04:58.598 --> 00:05:00.266
-Whoa!
-(MUSIC STOPS)

00:05:01.309 --> 00:05:02.852
Which one of you is Moon?

00:05:03.061 --> 00:05:05.021
Hey, hey, you can't just barge in here!

00:05:05.146 --> 00:05:06.648
You know this guy?

00:05:07.107 --> 00:05:08.608
-Mike?
-Right.

00:05:08.692 --> 00:05:12.153
Mike here says you got his money,
and it's in that box.

00:05:13.446 --> 00:05:15.490
No, no, just hold on a moment here.

00:05:15.573 --> 00:05:19.619
That's prize money,
and it's not Mike's unless he wins it fair and...

00:05:19.703 --> 00:05:20.912
-Give him the money!
-Okay! Okay!

00:05:21.079 --> 00:05:22.914
Hey, hey, take it! The whole chest!

00:05:22.998 --> 00:05:24.791
It's yours, okay? All right here.

00:05:24.874 --> 00:05:26.209
-Open it.
-(STAMMERING) Open it?

00:05:26.710 --> 00:05:27.711
Me?

00:05:28.378 --> 00:05:29.462
(CHOKING) Open it!

00:05:29.546 --> 00:05:30.964
(STAMMERING) Okay, no...

00:05:31.047 --> 00:05:32.590
I just don't have the keys.

00:05:32.674 --> 00:05:34.050
So, maybe you can come back later?

00:05:34.259 --> 00:05:35.844
-Get outta the way!
-(MIKE SCREAMS)

00:05:36.344 --> 00:05:38.430
No, no, no! Wait!

00:05:44.686 --> 00:05:46.187
(CHUCKLING) Hey, there you go!

00:05:46.271 --> 00:05:48.398
Big guy with a bat! Who needs keys, right?

00:05:48.481 --> 00:05:50.150
All right. Well, let's get
this thing squared up now.

00:05:51.901 --> 00:05:52.986
What the...

00:05:53.403 --> 00:05:54.404
That's it?

00:05:55.321 --> 00:05:56.781
That's all there is?

00:05:58.199 --> 00:05:59.242
He lied.

00:05:59.868 --> 00:06:01.244
-(ALL GASP)
-(GROWLS)

00:06:01.536 --> 00:06:02.871
Moon lied to us all!

00:06:02.954 --> 00:06:04.539
Wait a second. I can explain...

00:06:04.622 --> 00:06:06.332
-He's your problem, not me.
-This is just a prop.

00:06:06.416 --> 00:06:07.917
So where's the $100,000?

00:06:08.501 --> 00:06:09.502
ROSITA: You're kidding!

00:06:09.586 --> 00:06:11.171
JOHNNY: I cannot believe
you lied to us this whole time.

00:06:11.254 --> 00:06:12.547
ASH: Huge waste of everyone's...

00:06:12.630 --> 00:06:13.631
This was just...

00:06:13.798 --> 00:06:15.133
(GLASS CRACKING)

00:06:15.550 --> 00:06:16.593
(ALL GASP)

00:06:21.890 --> 00:06:22.891
Buster! Look out!

00:06:26.061 --> 00:06:27.270
(ALL SCREAMING)

00:06:33.860 --> 00:06:35.153
I'm stuck!

